{"GUN_FEAR","",{"Wait! I'm backing up, see my feet? I'm backing up","No-- please, don't!","Easy. I didn't come out here to die on somebody's lawn","I'll go. Tell me which direction and I'll go","Nobody's dead yet. Let's leave it that way","Oh God... no, no","Not over this. I'm not dying over this","Please. A few steps. Just give me a few steps","Please don't. Please, just don't","I heard you. I'm not arguing","Easy now. I want to live","You don't need to prove anything to me","I'm scared enough already","All right, all right. Just be careful","There has to be another way to do this","I don't want this to be the last thing I see","I'm trying not to shake. Give me a second","We can both walk away from this","Please think before you do anything","Don't let this go any further","I'll listen. I swear I'll listen","Slow down. Nobody needs to die over this"}},
{"GUN_FEAR","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Please. I've got a sister in West Point who thinks I'm coming","Hang on! I know where the church keeps its canned goods. I'll show you","I'm nobody, I bagged groceries at the Winn-Dixie","Name it! Money, boots, my wedding ring, name it","My hands won't stop shaking, look at them, please","Can I just walk away? I'll even go the long way round","Please. I got a dog at home that don't know how to open a can","No, no. I sing in the choir, I don't do this"}},
{"GUN_FEAR","reg=law,swat,military,elite",{"Backing up. Slow. You see me backing up","Hold it-- I'm lowering mine. See? It's going down","Fine. Take the spot, I'll find another","My orders don't cover this. I'm leaving","Tell them I walked away on my own two feet","Lower it, and I walk. That's the whole trade","I've got a family in Elizabethtown. I'm going home","Take what you need, just leave me my radio","I'm outgunned and I know it. Let me leave","Okay, you win. Write down that I said it","Easy. I didn't sign up for this part","I'll walk. I'll even salute if it helps","Point where you want me. I'll stand like a kid in time-out","I'm not dying over a roadblock. You can have it","Damn it, can we call this off? I'll take the blame"}},
{"GUN_FEAR","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"All right, hell, I'm backing off. Keep your toy","Aw, come on, I ain't worth the bullet. Ask my ex-wife","You don't have to like me. Just let me go","Shit, I'd sooner keep breathing and lose the argument","Easy, damn it! I'll leave the keys, I'll leave the boots!","Fine. I'll be quiet. Quiet as a church mouse","Backing off. That square us, or you want more?","You want me gone? Say it","Don't make it worse. I just want to leave","No, I ain't staying for this. I'm on foot and I'm still faster","Say what you like. Just let me leave","Aw, hell. Let's say I was never here. Nobody saw me","Don't. I'm good for it, whatever it is","Go on, call me a coward. I want out","Not worth it. I got a cousin in Paducah to see first","Oh, hell-- no. No thanks","I want no part of this. Tell the boys I got sick"}},
