{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","role=elite_operator,mercenary",{"Solid - stay off my muzzle"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=crime,outlaw,club",{"Huh - you're useful, that's rare and I'll remember it"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=outlaw,club,crime|tmp=seasoned,veteran|world=road",{"That'll get you down the road a ways, I guess"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=civilian,worker,outlaw|tmp=seasoned|mood=warm",{"You helped and didn't ask for nothing, twice this whole summer"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=worker,civilian|tmp=seasoned",{"Well I'll be damned, thank you kindly, whoever you are"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=civilian,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Thanks, don't you get bit being a hero, I ain't burying nobody else today"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Thank you! Oh my God, thank you!","You saved my life, I won't forget it","I thought that was it, I thought I was dead","Thank you- Lord, I thought that was it for me"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral",{"Appreciate the help, citizen, you're a good shot","You saved my skin, I owe you one","Thanks, that could have gone bad"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Good shot, thanks"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral",{"Good work, civilian - thanks","You've got a steady hand - appreciate it"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Nice shot! Hell, you're alright","Coulda handled it... but yeah, thanks","You just earned yourself a friend - don't make me regret it"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|rep=worst",{"You... you helped? Why? Oh God, is this a trick? What do you want?","Thank you, I think, I'm so confused, you're supposed to be...","That was... kind of you, I never expected that from you, never","You saved me? You? I... I don't know how to feel about this","Thank you, I guess, but it doesn't change what I know about you"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|rep=bad",{"Huh, you helped me, well, don't think it erases the past","Thanks... I guess even a bad person can do something good","I owe you one, don't push it","Huh, maybe you're not all bad, thank you","Thanks, I'll keep that in mind next time somebody says your name","Strange, a villain with a heart, who knew"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|rep=good",{"Thank you!! You did it again, you always do, thank you","Oh my God, you saved me, again, I can't thank you enough","You're a lifesaver, truly, I don't know what we'd do without you","You did it again!! You're amazing, truly, thank you","God bless you, I'd be dead without you","There you are, always showing up at the right time, thank you"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|rep=best",{"I knew it, I knew you'd come, they said the Legend always shows up","Oh thank you, thank you, I'll tell everyone, EVERYONE","It's like they say, the Legend never lets anyone down, thank you","You've done more for us than anyone, I don't know how to repay you"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=law,swat|rep=bad",{"Thanks, noted, don't think I forgot the rest","Thanks, noted, it doesn't clear your record"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=law,swat|rep=good",{"Thank you, truly, that was a close one","Thanks, partner, you've got a good eye"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=military,elite|rep=bad",{"Acknowledged, don't expect more","Acknowledged, you're still flagged"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=military,elite|rep=good",{"Thank you, good work","Nice work, soldier-in-spirit"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|rep=worst",{"Hah, the Villain saved me? The world's turned upside down","Ha, even monsters help each other sometimes, thanks"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|rep=bad",{"Huh, I didn't see that coming, thanks, I guess","Thanks, I owe you one, don't let it go to your head"}},
{"HELPED_BY_PLAYER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|rep=good",{"Thanks, hero, I owe you one, don't tell anyone","Thanks, hero, you've got a soft spot, but thanks"}},
{"HOLD_POSITION","reg=law",{"Stay here, nobody moves till I say","Hold there. Don't go wandering","Wait, let them come to us","Hold position, hold position","Stand your ground, deputies, hold","Nobody advances, hold what we have","Stay where you are, repeat, stay where you are","Hold fast, wait for backup","Don't pursue, I repeat, don't pursue","We hold here, we hold"}},
{"HOLD_POSITION","reg=law|world=road",{"Keep your spot, watch the road"}},
{"HOLD_POSITION","reg=swat",{"Hold","Stay put, eyes on the hall","Freeze in place - listen","Hold position","Holding, holding","Hold, hold, hold","Hold your sector","Hold here, eyes up","Hold fire, hold position"}},
{"HOLD_POSITION","reg=swat|world=door",{"Hold here, cover the door"}},
{"HOLD_POSITION","reg=military,elite",{"Hold your position!","Stay put, hold this line","Nobody moves - hold","Hold here until relieved"}},
{"HOLD_POSITION","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Stay here, don't move","Wait, just wait a second","We stay put - okay?","Don't go anywhere, please"}},
{"HOLD_POSITION","reg=raider,outlaw,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Sit tight","Stay here and keep your mouth shut","Hang back, let 'em walk into it","Wait for it"}},
{"HOLD_POSITION","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Stay here, okay? Stay right here, don't move","Don't go anywhere, I'm scared if you leave","Stay put, stay put, just wait, wait for it","Wait for it... wait, nobody run yet","Nobody runs, we stick together here","We stay here, right? We stay?","Wait, wait, I think we should wait"}},
{"HOLD_POSITION","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Hold here, hold here, don't chase it","Stay put, let them come to us","Nobody moves, wait for my word","Stand fast, we've got a good spot","Hold your ground, hold your ground, steady","Wait for it, wait for it, don't waste a shot","We stay, we hold, we wait them out","Don't go out there, they want us to go out there","Stay close. I don't want us stumbling into trouble"}},
{"HOLD_POSITION","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|mood=calm",{"We hold here, let them make the first move","Hold position, we're fine where we are"}},
{"HOLD_POSITION","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|mood=angry",{"Hold it! HOLD IT! Which part of 'stay put' did you not get?!"}},
{"HOLD_POSITION","reg=military",{"Hold your position, hold your position","Stand fast, soldiers","Hold the line, don't fall back","Hold, hold, hold, wait for orders","Nobody moves without my command","Hold position, sir, holding"}},
{"HOLD_POSITION","role=soldier_green",{"Hold? We hold? Okay, okay, I'm holding","Staying put, sir, staying right here"}},
{"HOLD_POSITION","role=soldier_nco",{"Hold what you've got, trainee, hold it","Stand your ground, I'm right behind you"}},
{"HOLD_POSITION","reg=elite",{"Hold","Holding","Hold position, wait"}},
{"HOLD_POSITION","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Hold it! Hold it right there, boys!","Nobody move, nobody fuckin' move","Stay put, I'll tell you when","Hold your ground, you cowards, hold it!","We sit tight and let them walk into us","Wait for it, wait for it, wait for it...","Don't go chasing after them, you moron, hold","Stay down, stay quiet, hold your fire"}},
{"HOT","",{"Heat's like a wet blanket, can't breathe in it","Sweat in my eyes, sweat in my boots","Ninety-five and the air's like a sponge","This is Kentucky in summer, it's always like this","Can't stand the sun on my neck - get me some shade","Even the cicadas sound tired","Heat shimmer off the blacktop, looks like water - it isn't","Hot as the hinges of hell - pardon me","Sweat's soaking through, I'd kill for a fan","This heat's gonna bake the dead faster, not a pleasant thought","It's so fucking hot, stay hydrated or we'll run out of energy before the day's over","Hot, hot, hot, I'm melting","Sweat's running down my back, down my legs, everywhere","Sun's beating down like a hammer","Not a breath of wind, not one","My shirt's stuck to me, peel it off, peel it","Heat's making me dizzy, hold on a sec","Hotter than blue blazes out here","Ninety-eight in the shade, if there was any shade","Feels hot enough to cook me alive","Dog days, and it's not even August","Air so thick you could chew it","Every step I take, I leave a puddle","Sunburn, I'm burning, my nose is peeling"}},
{"HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Sit in the shade - no heroics","I'd swim in a cattle trough right now","It's so hot, I feel faint","Can we stand in the shade a minute?"}},
{"HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Drink water, a little, every few minutes"}},
{"HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"Air conditioning, that's what I miss most, not even food"}},
{"HOT","reg=military,elite",{"Hydrate, salt tablets if you've got 'em","Hot as hell, drink water when you can","Heat advisory, ease off, conserve energy","Hotter than Georgia in August, and that's saying something"}},
{"HOT","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran",{"Heat is an enemy like any other - respect it","Seen hotter than this, quit complaining"}},
{"HOT","reg=law,swat",{"Uniform's soaked through - stinks","Sweat through the uniform again, third time today"}},
{"HOT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Damn heat, I'm gonna take someone's iced tea","Too hot to fight, too hot to run","I'm melting - find some shade","Fuck, it's hot, my shirt's soaked through","Hot as hell, hotter than hell, hell's got nothing on this","I'm gonna kill the next guy who complains about the heat, ha, sorry, I'm complaining","Sweat in my eyes, can't see, can't think, can't stand it"}},
{"HOT","world=water",{"A creek, that's what I need - any creek"}},
{"HOT","reg=law",{"Sweating through my uniform - it's brutal"}},
{"HOT","reg=military",{"Heat's getting to me - need water"}},
{"HOT","world=building",{"I feel like a roast in the oven, and somebody forgot me"}},
{"HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"I'm dizzy, I'm seeing spots, I think I'm going to faint","It's too hot to run, if they come now, I can't run","Heat messes with my head, I keep hearing things"}},
{"HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=sad",{"It was this hot the day we left, I remember the sweat on my daughter's neck","Fourth of July was this hot, I wore a hat, but it didn't help"}},
{"HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Rest in the shade, move in the morning and the evening","Wet a rag, put it on your neck, it helps a lot","Slow down, don't push it, heat kills the careless","Hat on, sleeves down, cover up, it keeps the sun off"}},
{"HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny|world=vehicle",{"Hot enough to fry an egg on the hood of a car, if I had an egg, or a car, ha"}},
{"HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=funny",{"My momma said this heat would melt a crowbar, I believe her now","It's so hot even the dead are sweating, heh"}},
{"HOT","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=angry",{"Damn heat, damn sun, damn everything","If one more person says it's a dry heat, I'm going to scream"}},
{"HOT","reg=rescue",{"Somebody's gonna keel over from the heat, watch for it","Check on the elderly, the kids, anybody who's slowing down"}},
{"HOT","role=rescue_medical",{"Salt and water, salt and water, slow sips, that's the cure"}},
{"HOT","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Eighty pounds of gear in this heat, I've done it, you can handle a walk"}},
{"HOT","reg=law,swat|world=vehicle,road",{"Heat in the cruiser used to kill me, now it's heat on the street"}},
{"HOT","reg=law,swat|tmp=veteran",{"Same as a ride-along in August, only with fewer drunks"}},
{"HOT","reg=swat",{"Get out of the sun, strip some gear, you're cooking"}},
{"HOT","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|mood=angry",{"This heat's gonna make somebody snap, and it's gonna be me"}},
{"HOT","hour=11,15",{"Noon sun, right on the top of my head, like a branding iron","Midday and nowhere to hide, find some shade, any shade"}},
{"HOT","hour=16,20",{"Still hot, even with the sun going down, the ground's still cooking"}},
{"HOT","hour=21,4",{"Even the night won't cool down, can't sleep, can't breathe"}},
