{"IDLE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Hm, quiet - that's good","Just waiting, waiting is the worst part"}},
{"IDLE","reg=law",{"All quiet"}},
{"IDLE","reg=military",{"Standing by"}},
{"IDLE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"This is boring","Bored, bored, bored, I need to hit something","This is dumb, why are we just sitting here","Come on, let's go do something, anything","Watch's too slow, too damn slow","I'd start a fight just to break the monotony","Somebody tell a joke, a dirty one","If something doesn't happen soon, I'm making it happen","Nothing's out there, nothing, let's go find some trouble"}},
{"IDLE","",{"Nothing... nothing... more nothing","I could get bored enough to count cracks","Anybody else bored out of their mind?","Ugh, this is the longest watch of my life","If I have to stand around one more minute-","Tap, tap, tap, tapping my foot, can't stop","How many hours left? Don't tell me","I could get bored enough to count bricks","Is it me or did the clock stop?","I keep reading the same sign over and over","My butt's gone numb from sitting","Wake me when something happens, anything","I'd pay good money for a deck of cards","Watching nothing happen is its own kind of job","Hurry up, hurry up, hurry up, someone relieve me","I've seen this exact bird three times now","I'm so bored I'm starting to like the quiet","I counted the clouds, there were eleven, now there's nine","Yawning again, don't tell the others"}},
{"IDLE","world=road",{"Same street, same trash, same shadow"}},
{"IDLE","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=sad",{"I keep thinking if I sit here long enough, it'll all be a dream","My mind goes places when it's quiet, bad places","This is when it hurts, when nothing's happening"}},
{"IDLE","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=fresh|mood=fear",{"It's too quiet, too quiet, what are they doing, what's out there","Every little sound and I think it's them","I can't relax, I can't, my body won't let me"}},
{"IDLE","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=calm",{"Quiet's good, quiet's what we pay for","Don't mind the boredom, boredom means nobody's dying","I do crossword puzzles in my head, helps pass the time","Quiet day, and I'll take it","Still here, still breathing, that's the report"}},
{"IDLE","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned|mood=funny",{"Dale's whole shift at the feed store looked like this, heh","Haven't been this bored since church camp","If I get any more bored, I'll start talking to myself, oh wait, I already am","Somebody should invent television, wait, they did, damn"}},
{"IDLE","reg=civilian,family,worker|mood=warm",{"At least I'm bored with people I like","Nothing better than a boring day among friends"}},
{"IDLE","reg=rescue",{"Waiting is the worst part of any job, in any uniform","Quiet shift, I'll take it, God knows I earned it","Keep an eye out, but don't strain, tired eyes see ghosts"}},
{"IDLE","role=rescue_medical",{"Slow night in the ER, they used to say you never say that word out loud","Checked my kit three times, it's still all there, count it again"}},
{"IDLE","role=rescue_clergy",{"A quiet watch is a good chance to pray, so I do","Counting the beads, one by one, it passes the hours"}},
{"IDLE","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Station house boredom, now I miss it, can you believe that"}},
{"IDLE","role=rescue_firefighter|world=vehicle",{"Wash the truck, check the hose, wait, repeat, those were the days"}},
{"IDLE","reg=law,swat",{"Slow patrol, long hours, nothing but wind","Used to be donuts and radio, now it's just radio, and no one on it","Writing reports in my head just to stay awake","Stay on it, don't drift off","Nobody to ticket, nobody to arrest, strange to miss it"}},
{"IDLE","reg=law,swat|tmp=veteran",{"Twenty years of watching nothing, you get good at it","Most of this job is waiting, nobody tells you"}},
{"IDLE","reg=swat",{"Waiting for the action, waiting for the call, waiting","Standing post, scanning, repeat, my favorite part, not"}},
{"IDLE","reg=military,elite",{"Post duty, uneventful, noted","Scanning, scanning, scanning, report: nothing","Stay awake... coffee would be nice","Sergeant says boredom builds character, I say it builds callouses"}},
{"IDLE","reg=military,elite|world=building",{"Another watch, another wall, another sector"}},
{"IDLE","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran|mood=calm",{"Boredom is a luxury, savor it"}},
{"IDLE","reg=military,elite|tmp=veteran|hour=20,5|mood=calm",{"Counting the stars again, lost track at forty"}},
{"IDLE","reg=military,elite|tmp=fresh|mood=sad",{"Wish I was back home, even the boring part of home","Every hour feels like three"}},
{"IDLE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|tmp=predator",{"Waiting's for suckers, let's get moving","Patience, patience, I hate patience"}},
{"IDLE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|mood=funny",{"Anyone bring a deck? A bottle? A dirty magazine? Anything?","Entertain me, monkeys, dance"}},
{"IDLE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|mood=angry",{"I am gonna scream, I am","Who the fuck decided I should stand here for six hours"}},
{"IDLE","hour=21,4",{"Night watch, nothing but crickets and my own thoughts","Dark and boring is a bad mix, makes the mind wander","Eyes stinging, head nodding, no, no, wake up","The stars are the only show, and I've seen it already","Every shadow's got a face by now, must be the lack of sleep"}},
{"IDLE","hour=5,8",{"Almost morning... come on, sun","The sky's starting to lighten, one more hour, just one more"}},
{"IDLE","hour=11,15",{"Heat, boredom, and flies, the holy trinity","Sun's high, I'm drowsy, someone slap me"}},
{"IDLE","hour=16,20|world=road",{"Evening's coming, and I'm still staring at the same patch of road"}},
{"IDLE","hour=16,20",{"Light's going soft, long shadows, nothing moving"}},
